.TH KULAN-UPDATES 1 "October 2026" "Kulan OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kulan-updates \- Kulan OS Update Center
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kulan-updates
[\fB\-\-check\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kulan-updates
shows the updates waiting for this computer, with security updates marked,
and installs them with a progress bar. It also shows what is new in each
Kulan OS release, the most recent updates, and the settings for automatic
updates and restore points.
.PP
Installing updates and changing settings asks for an administrator password
through
.BR pkexec (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Check for new updates as soon as the window opens.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/kulan/updates.json
Update status, refreshed after every apt run and at boot.
.TP
.I ~/.config/kulan/updates.ini
The "Create a restore point before installing" choice.
.TP
.I /usr/share/kulan/release-notes.json
The release notes shown under What's new.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR apt (8),
.BR timeshift (1),
.BR unattended-upgrade (8)
